  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: Can be both. Pattern: X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{喜|よろこ}ぶ (be happy about X) / X⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{喜|よろこ}ぶ (X is happy).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates state. {喜|よろこ}んで⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'is happy/delighted.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- X⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{喜|よろこ}ぶ (be happy about X)\n- {喜|よろこ}んで (gladly, with pleasure)\n- {喜|よろこ}ばせる (make someone happy—causative)\n- ⟦{大喜|おおよろこ}び→大喜び：28880_ooyorokobi⟧ (great joy)\n- ⟦お{喜|よろこ}び→喜び：03672_yorokobi⟧ (congratulations—polite noun)\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {喜|よろこ}んで！ (With pleasure! / Gladly!)\n- お⟦{喜|よろこ}び→喜び：03672_yorokobi⟧⟦{申|もう}し{上|あ}げます→申し上げる：01734_moushiageru⟧ (Congratulations—formal)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{喜|よろこ}び→喜び：03672_yorokobi⟧ (joy, happiness—noun)\n- ⟦{嬉|うれ}しい→嬉しい：00822_ureshii⟧ (happy, glad—adjective, more common in casual speech)",
